stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  NX: OBJECT_NONEXISTENT (0)
  EX: OBJECT_EXISTS (1)
  PD: OBJECT_PENDING (2)
  CL: OBJECT_EXISTS_CLEAN (3)
  [*] --> NX: image or clone created
  NX --> EX: before the first write (map updated before the write)
  CL --> EX: write after a snapshot
  EX --> CL: snap create, every EXISTS in HEAD
  EX --> PD: object discard or remove (before removal)
  CL --> PD: object discard or remove
  PD --> NX: after a successful removal
